{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LD8B4VluLD1KK2UYwxaUxQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:45.382492+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LD8B4VluLD1KK2UYwxaUxQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/aswSEl5JBthAIyf7Jz1ZJgL8bv3gmrC704iapwHg4W0hJND3OSjicCeTmGia0oTxibuWkKUbvEnwsphEGgmHyO6xNpOGvxzPu4OHJFQOYDmkWOI/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aswSEl5JBtjicrNY5vNticK2r7bkwUI4ztRWjmKdwJkiaWjRcdeJx4xwMjjCPhzSI0qmx73KQhYSVuBeYx1eRuQqQab1C9fnGjtJL3g5H9j5FE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>高温轻合金及应用技术全国重点实验室是由河南科技大学牵头组建的我国高温轻合金材料领域唯一的全国重点实验室。实验室面向世界科技前沿、面向经济建设主战场、面向国家重大战略需求、面向人民生命健康，不断向科学技术广度和深度进军，致力于高温轻合金（含高温合金、难熔金属、轻合金等）材料设计、制备、成形、加工及应用基础理论和关键技术研究，已形成了以中国科学院院士陈光教授为实验室主任领衔的研究团队。实验室具有材料科学与工程、冶金工程、机械工程等一级学科博士授权点，材料与化工、机械等专业学位博士授权点，建有博士后科研流动站。</span></span></p><p><span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）招生录取工作即将启动，高温轻合金及应用技术全国重点实验室即日起接收“2027年推荐免试入学研究生”预报名，欢迎优秀应届本科毕业生报名。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aswSEl5JBth5sIzVTDAJiafAR9x7J06LQBJUicwS05Wb2aibbgOouibOnxu8uO60ApYy7y4t9k1lIeUQjcwsm2fC89khcTtDDibZliaicRYicQmCj1c/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><span>一、预报名时间</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2026年8月29日-9月21日</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><span>二、接收专业</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>各全日制专业均接收推免生。最终招生专业以2027年招生专业目录为准（详见学校招生简章）。</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aswSEl5JBtjPxkZ4piboZKKSYqZMiaTBmgYM6cUut1BEkGgBjYw0Xmxic0TVicEXvrLH979ibOqVp8AztsRPKFLS6UN9Dv6e2XA2MPiauR1icutBRk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><span>三、预报名方式</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>报名考生请将以下材料（电子版）发送到邮箱quanzhong@haust.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.《个人简历》</span></span></p><p><span>包含报名专业、本科专业以及各种奖励、论文、科研情况等。</span></p><p><span>2.《个人陈述表》</span></p><p><span>包含个人学术背景、曾参与过的科研工作、科研学术兴趣、攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、其他特长以及你认为对于申请有参考价值的内容。</span></p><p><span>3.本科阶段成绩单（须加盖学校教务部门公章）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><span><span>四、复试安排</span></span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>分批审核申请信息，工作人员与报名考生联系，确认相关信息并通知面试，请考生保持联系方式畅通。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><span>五、特别提醒</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.通过本次预报名并取得拟录取资格的学生，在取得本科毕业学校推免资格后，须在我校规定时间内，登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（简称“推免服务系统”，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm），填写并提交河南科技大学志愿，完成正式报名及拟录取相关流程，否则无效。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.复试录取相关事项见我校研究生院官网后续发布的河南科技大学2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生章程。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><span>六、联系方式</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人:研究生办公室 梁老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话:18624867096</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><span>高温轻合金及应用技术全国重点实验室</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>2026年8月29日</span></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>END</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>编辑：董寒雨</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审：李芳</span></span></p><p><span><span>复审：梁浩</span></span></p><p><span><span>终审：张柯柯</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"199bca8e3af34e6d8cb0febfd8037c584f74445b9c17cd4ab5582e945f048d29","textLength":941,"source